## How to Use New Features

### Theme Switching
1. Click the sun/moon icon in the top-right of the header
2. Theme switches instantly
3. Preference saved automatically

### Import from URL
1. On upload page, click "Import from URL" button
2. Enter CSV file URL
3. Click "Import"

### Add/Delete Rows
1. Click "Add Row" to append empty row
2. Select rows with checkboxes
3. Click "Delete" to remove selected rows

### Generate Charts
1. Click "Charts" button in toolbar
2. Select chart type (bar/line/pie/etc.)
3. Choose column to visualize
4. Click "Generate"
5. Click "Close" to return to spreadsheet

### Export to Excel
1. Click "Export Excel" button
2. .xlsx file downloads automatically

